Title: Bayesian Nowcasting of Data with Reporting Delay
Package: RDNowcast
Encoding: UTF-8
Type: Package
Version: 1.0.3
Date: 2026-07-08
Authors@R: person("Ivo", "Foppa", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ivo.foppa@gmail.com")
Description: This R package generates ``full'' numbers, when observed numbers are affected by reporting delay. This happens in two steps: 
    First, posterior samples of `p`, the data completeness, are drawn, based on external data. 
    Second, given these completeness estimates, random numbers are generated, representing projected ``full'' numbers.
